{%- comment -%}
Shows an option name or value (Size, Color, "Cobalt Blue"…) or a short store label in the visitor's language. The product data stays in
English, so colour swatches and variant matching keep working; this only changes the words shown.
Usage: {% render 'mim-tr', text: option.name %}. Unknown words are shown as they are.
{%- endcomment -%}
